# Everything in this directory is extracted from baserom.gba on first run
# (port_asset_bootstrap.cpp) and must not be committed -- see the note in the
# root .gitignore about copyrighted ROM content.
#
# The exceptions are the hand-authored asset *configuration* that the
# extractor and the decomp build read. Those are source, not output.
#
# Do not restore a blanket `!*.json`: the extractor writes JSON here too
# (gfx_groups, palette_groups, palettes, tilemaps, texts, sprite_ptrs,
# area_*, .asset_build_state), and the blanket rule tracked four of those by
# accident -- each had exactly one commit, the one that added extraction.
*
!.gitignore
!assets.json
!gfx.json
!map.json
!samples.json
!sounds.json
